  "about": {
    "title": "EncodeX pillugu",
    "subtitle": "FFmpeg-mi tunngaveqartumik akisiutissaqanngitsumik aamma open source-imik multimedia-sakkutissat. Nipit, videot aamma assit allanngortikkit, misissoruk, komprimeruk, anitseruk, qimassoruk aamma batch-imik suliarisinnassavai — tamarmik ataatsimi.",
    "description": "EncodeX multimedia-toolkit cross-platform-uvoq FFmpeg-ip sunniutaanik moderni, intuitivi desktop-interface-mut atuutsiissutigineqartoq. Nipit, videot aamma assit formatinik allanngortinneqarsinnaapput codec-it, bitrate, resolution, pixel-format aamma kvalitet-imik nakussagaqarneq annertusisumik; track-it anngunnaateqanngitsumik kopioruk remux-tassamut; video-miit nipit anitseruk; aamma video qimassoruk frame-akkuratungasutigut preview-player-ikkut. Hardware-accelerated encoding NVIDIA NVENC, Intel QSV, AMD AMF, VAAPI, Apple VideoToolbox aamma Microsoft Media Foundation-i tersorsimavaa, encoderit atorneqarsinnaasut runtime-mi FFmpeg-binærimiit automatisk-iusumik takuneqartut. Batch-jobsit queue-persistent-imikkut suliffigineqarput progress-real-time-ikkut, aamma headless-CLI-mode-ip taamaattumik piginnaasaatit scripting-imi aamma automation-imi atuutsinneqarput.",
